        "new_str": "## BC-Based Alternatives Identified\n1. **Professional Sales Academy (Vancouver)** - ESP program, CPSA-accredited, B2B/SaaS focused, customized\n2. **Sandler Training (BC)** - Enterprise selling, behavior/attitude focus, tech-enabled\n3. **Langara College (Vancouver)** - Professional Sales short cert, $382/course, consultative\n4. **BCIT (Vancouver)** - Professional Sales Skills, relationship/needs-based selling, $200-400\n5. **UVic Continuing Studies** - Professional Sales Skills, consultative approach\n6. **SOCO Sales Training (Vancouver)** - Custom programs, pre-training assessments, long-term behavior change\n7. **TradeUpBC** - 36-hour professional sales program, B2B relationship selling\n\n## Competitive Analysis Points\n- Dale Carnegie chosen for: **timeless relationship-building methodology**, **structured 8-week format matches ClearDent timeline**, **proven framework proven across complex B2B environments**, **emotional intelligence and authentic trust-building (vs mechanical process-focused alternatives)**, **established track record in SaaS and technology sectors**\n- Advantages over BC alternatives: Recognized brand/history, proven sales model (not just consulting/coaching), established Canadian delivery (BC location available), real-world applicability for account expansion\n\n## Workflow Status\n- [x] Eligibility verified\n- [x] Company/participant info gathered\n- [x] Questions 1-3 drafted\n- [x] BC alternatives researched\n- [ ] Questions 4-7 drafted"
